"文件内容自动拆分为可编辑块。PDF 根据文字和版式识别标题、正文、列表、代码与引用；扫描页保留图片并尝试本地文字识别。复杂格式可能需要整理。文档及内嵌资源总量不超过 100 MB。" = "Files are split into editable blocks. PDF text and layout help identify headings, paragraphs, lists, code, and quotes. Scanned pages retain images with on-device text recognition where possible. Complex formatting may need editing. Total content and embedded assets must not exceed 100 MB.";

